[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/217686090","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/8785#issuecomment-217686090","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/8785","id":217686090,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIxNzY4NjA5MA==","user":{"login":"thinkingmedia","id":551022,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTAyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/551022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia","html_url":"https://github.com/thinkingmedia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-05-08T02:44:46Z","updated_at":"2016-05-08T02:44:46Z","body":"I suspect this is the problem in `DatabaseSession.php`.\n\n```\n    public function destroy($id)\n    {\n        return (bool)$this->_table->delete(new Entity(\n            [$this->_table->primaryKey() => $id],\n            ['markNew' => false]\n        ));\n    }\n```\n\nThe above returns `false` if the record was missing, but take a look at the `gc` function.\n\n```\n    public function gc($maxlifetime)\n    {\n        $this->_table->deleteAll(['expires <' => time() - $maxlifetime]);\n        return true;\n    }\n```\n\nThe above deletes all expired records.\n\nSo, I am thinking that after a session has expired it's deleted by `gc`, and then the `session_regenerate_id(true)` triggers a call to the delete method which returns false for failure. Thus the error is trigger.\n\nHow on earth do you even unit test this?\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/217686090/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"thinkingmedia","id":551022,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTAyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/551022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia","html_url":"https://github.com/thinkingmedia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thinkingmedia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":653662307,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDY1MzY2MjMwNw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/events/653662307","actor":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/o